1
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:12,530
♪Mighty winds carry me to the heavens♪

2
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:15,700
♪On a wild steed,
I sing, smiling at the mortal world♪

3
00:00:16,130 --> 00:00:18,530
♪Then the cold night veils the stars♪

4
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:21,710
♪I fall to the depths, yet walk alone♪

5
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:26,050
♪I brave countless snowy peaks♪

6
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:29,270
♪Your lingering warmth still fills
my palm♪

7
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:32,070
♪Though frost and snow may bar my way♪

8
00:00:32,310 --> 00:00:35,940
♪The light in my eyes will never fade♪

9
00:00:36,290 --> 00:00:39,410
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

10
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:42,760
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

11
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:45,680
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

12
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:49,010
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

13
00:00:56,940 --> 00:00:58,860
=Sword God=

14
00:00:59,140 --> 00:01:00,380
=Episode 7=

15
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:02,560
I, Zhao Feiyang,
haven't been tested yet.

16
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:03,520
Zhao Feiyang,

17
00:01:03,640 --> 00:01:05,200
didn't you hear what the elder said?

18
00:01:05,680 --> 00:01:07,510
The trial is already over.

19
00:01:07,680 --> 00:01:09,310
What are you even testing for?

20
00:01:09,430 --> 00:01:10,280
Even if you take it,

21
00:01:10,510 --> 00:01:11,760
you're just putting on a show.

22
00:01:12,150 --> 00:01:13,310
Why waste everyone's time?

23
00:01:13,480 --> 00:01:14,230
According to the rules,

24
00:01:14,790 --> 00:01:16,590
every outer disciple has the right
to take the test.

25
00:01:16,950 --> 00:01:17,920
Why can't I?

26
00:01:20,310 --> 00:01:21,000
Zhao Feiyang,

27
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:23,840
I know it's been tough for you
all these years.

28
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:25,350
So there's no need to test.

29
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:26,590
Sect Master, what do you mean?

30
00:01:26,790 --> 00:01:29,200
Considering your years of loyalty,

31
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:31,560
as long as you break no rules,

32
00:01:31,870 --> 00:01:33,790
you can always stay here

33
00:01:34,040 --> 00:01:35,150
as an outer disciple.

34
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:36,150
Sect Master, you can't!

35
00:01:36,510 --> 00:01:37,560
No outer disciple

36
00:01:37,760 --> 00:01:39,350
stays in our sect forever.

37
00:01:39,950 --> 00:01:42,040
Won't that eat into everyone else's
cultivation resources?

38
00:01:42,350 --> 00:01:42,840
Exactly!

39
00:01:42,950 --> 00:01:43,590
Yeah.

40
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:45,950
Exactly.

41
00:01:45,950 --> 00:01:46,840
Why should he?

42
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:48,560
Elder Wang,

43
00:01:48,950 --> 00:01:50,000
(Heavenly Sword Sect)
Zhao Feiyang

44
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:52,120
has contributed to our sect before.

45
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:54,760
It's only natural for the Sect Master
to make an exception for him.

46
00:01:55,870 --> 00:01:56,350
That's right.

47
00:01:57,350 --> 00:01:57,920
Zhao Feiyang,

48
00:01:58,230 --> 00:02:00,400
the Sect Master is giving you
one last bit of dignity.

49
00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:02,120
Hurry and thank him.

50
00:02:02,350 --> 00:02:04,280
Consider yourself lucky this time.

51
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:05,350
Dignity?

52
00:02:06,950 --> 00:02:08,710
After three years,
what's left of my dignity?

53
00:02:09,630 --> 00:02:10,080
Sect Master,

54
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:11,870
I don't need

55
00:02:12,590 --> 00:02:13,680
this kind of dignity.

56
00:02:13,870 --> 00:02:14,310
You...

57
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:17,560
Talk about ungrateful!

58
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:18,960
He just turned it down.

59
00:02:19,710 --> 00:02:21,280
(Guess I can't stay here anymore.)

60
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:23,840
(I need another way
to repair my meridians.)

61
00:02:28,470 --> 00:02:28,910
Wait!

62
00:02:31,360 --> 00:02:31,870
Father,

63
00:02:32,590 --> 00:02:33,750
let him take the test.

64
00:02:38,750 --> 00:02:39,360
(Zhao Feiyang,)

65
00:02:39,910 --> 00:02:40,840
(you can't leave.)

66
00:02:41,150 --> 00:02:42,000
(If you go,)

67
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:44,030
(how can you witness my rise?)

68
00:02:45,590 --> 00:02:46,280
Zhao Feiyang,

69
00:02:46,710 --> 00:02:47,560
go ahead and take the test.

70
00:02:47,910 --> 00:02:48,750
Even if you fail,

71
00:02:49,030 --> 00:02:50,430
our sect will still wish you

72
00:02:50,470 --> 00:02:52,120
a bright future.

73
00:02:52,310 --> 00:02:52,960
Thank you, Sect Master.

74
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:53,870
Enough.

75
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:55,240
Hurry up and take the test!

76
00:03:01,710 --> 00:03:02,680
(Just what grade)

77
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,120
(is the Dao Bone in me?)

78
00:03:04,630 --> 00:03:06,960
(I'll use the testing stone
to find out.)

79
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:14,240
Yellow?

80
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:16,030
Impossible.

81
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:17,430
Yellow?

82
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:21,080
Anything wrong with the testing stone?

83
00:03:25,030 --> 00:03:26,520
He had yellow talent three years ago.

84
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:28,840
After three years of being powerless,
he still has yellow talent.

85
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:30,630
That's unbelievable!

86
00:03:32,470 --> 00:03:34,470
No wonder he insisted
on taking the test.

87
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:36,560
So he was confident all along.

88
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:37,710
Three years of biding his time...

89
00:03:38,030 --> 00:03:39,430
Is he finally turning things around?

90
00:03:41,030 --> 00:03:41,630
Not bad.

91
00:03:42,030 --> 00:03:43,910
Biding your time
and building up your strength.

92
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:45,470
Zhao Feiyang,

93
00:03:45,750 --> 00:03:47,430
you've truly impressed me.

94
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:48,360
(Zhao Feiyang,)

95
00:03:48,630 --> 00:03:50,190
(I knew you never gave up.)

96
00:03:50,470 --> 00:03:52,680
(But you're still far behind me.)

97
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:54,190
Enough. No more testing.

98
00:03:54,710 --> 00:03:56,430
You are now a formal disciple.

99
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:57,400
What's the rush?

100
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:59,030
It's not over yet.

101
00:04:13,700 --> 00:04:17,550
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

102
00:04:17,590 --> 00:04:20,420
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

103
00:04:20,420 --> 00:04:23,140
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

104
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:24,360
What?

105
00:04:25,630 --> 00:04:26,830
Oh my...

106
00:04:27,950 --> 00:04:28,480
Could it be...

107
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:29,800
Am I dreaming?

108
00:04:30,740 --> 00:04:32,540
♪Every wound, every ache♪

109
00:04:32,540 --> 00:04:34,180
♪I turn them all into strength♪

110
00:04:34,180 --> 00:04:35,820
♪Even if fate is fickle♪

111
00:04:35,820 --> 00:04:37,380
♪And breaks my wings♪

112
00:04:37,920 --> 00:04:38,970
♪I will take to the sky♪

113
00:04:38,970 --> 00:04:41,380
♪And bravely fly once more♪

114
00:04:41,750 --> 00:04:43,530
♪Look at this blade of mine♪

115
00:04:43,530 --> 00:04:45,340
♪Still shining cold and bright♪

116
00:04:45,340 --> 00:04:48,020
♪The fire in me burns even wilder♪

117
00:04:48,780 --> 00:04:51,220
♪No matter what, I won't yield♪

118
00:04:51,220 --> 00:04:52,140
♪Let all the world♪

119
00:04:52,140 --> 00:04:54,580
♪Remember my face♪

120
00:04:59,920 --> 00:05:00,920
That is...

121
00:05:01,510 --> 00:05:02,630
A True Dragon?

122
00:05:02,630 --> 00:05:03,600
No...

123
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:04,310
No way.

124
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:05,630
Absolutely impossible!

125
00:05:06,070 --> 00:05:07,270
With his unranked Dao Bone

126
00:05:07,390 --> 00:05:08,560
and Stage 1 of the
Body Tempering Realm,

127
00:05:08,870 --> 00:05:11,070
how could he make the spirit stone
glow black?

128
00:05:11,190 --> 00:05:12,510
But the truth is right before us.

129
00:05:12,950 --> 00:05:13,830
We all saw it.

130
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:15,000
We're about...

131
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:16,920
about to see his Dao Bone
and cultivation level!

132
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:18,070
(Zhao Feiyang,)

133
00:05:18,430 --> 00:05:19,600
(no wonder you looked down on me.)

134
00:05:19,830 --> 00:05:21,160
(You've been hiding your strength!)

135
00:05:21,580 --> 00:05:22,540
(Body Tempering Realm, Stage 9)

136
00:05:23,920 --> 00:05:24,600
Stage 9?

137
00:05:26,070 --> 00:05:26,720
Stage 9?

138
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:28,240
What...

139
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:31,430
He was only at Stage 1 yesterday.

140
00:05:31,950 --> 00:05:33,360
Today he's already at Stage 9?

141
00:05:33,510 --> 00:05:33,870
How...

142
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:35,240
how did he pull that off?

143
00:05:36,310 --> 00:05:37,680
(Body Tempering Realm, Stage 9)
But at his age,

144
00:05:37,830 --> 00:05:38,630
this level of cultivation

145
00:05:38,830 --> 00:05:39,870
shouldn't make the spirit stone

146
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:41,160
emit black light.

147
00:05:41,510 --> 00:05:43,480
Maybe the Dao Bone he obtained

148
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:44,680
is no ordinary one?

149
00:05:47,700 --> 00:05:50,140
(Body Tempering Realm, Stage 9.
Dao Bone Grade...)

150
00:05:53,070 --> 00:05:53,870
What's going on?

151
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:55,750
Why is it so hard

152
00:05:56,510 --> 00:05:58,600
to tell his Dao Bone grade?

153
00:05:58,750 --> 00:05:59,360
Yeah.

154
00:06:00,390 --> 00:06:00,870
Wang,

155
00:06:01,070 --> 00:06:02,870
is something wrong with
your precious spirit stone?

156
00:06:03,120 --> 00:06:04,040
No way.

157
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:07,040
It's always worked perfectly

158
00:06:07,240 --> 00:06:08,120
for nearly a century.

159
00:06:08,390 --> 00:06:09,510
It can't just go wrong.

160
00:06:13,360 --> 00:06:14,920
(Why can't the Dao Bone grade
be revealed?)

161
00:06:15,510 --> 00:06:16,510
(Maybe I'm not using enough power?)

162
00:06:35,430 --> 00:06:36,680
My precious stone!

163
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:40,160
How could this happen?

164
00:06:40,560 --> 00:06:41,800
The testing stone...

165
00:06:42,750 --> 00:06:43,480
is broken!

166
00:06:46,310 --> 00:06:47,600
Your precious stone is broken now, huh?

167
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:48,950
Zhao Feiyang,

168
00:06:49,160 --> 00:06:49,920
I'm furious!

169
00:06:50,160 --> 00:06:51,240
Get out of here at once!

170
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:52,630
Leave this sect!

171
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:54,430
I made the spirit stone shine.

172
00:06:54,630 --> 00:06:55,240
According to the rules,

173
00:06:55,390 --> 00:06:56,630
I should be a formal disciple now.

174
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:57,830
Why should I leave?

175
00:06:58,120 --> 00:07:00,120
Can't you see my testing stone

176
00:07:00,190 --> 00:07:01,070
is already broken?

177
00:07:01,360 --> 00:07:02,270
Your Dao Bone grade

178
00:07:02,510 --> 00:07:04,310
wasn't displayed at all!

179
00:07:04,630 --> 00:07:05,270
Exactly.

180
00:07:05,680 --> 00:07:07,160
Otherwise, at his current level,

181
00:07:07,630 --> 00:07:09,750
making the spirit stone glow black

182
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:11,190
would be unbelievable.

183
00:07:11,310 --> 00:07:12,630
I see.

184
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:15,800
I thought Heaven was blessing us again.

185
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:18,830
(Looks like it was a false alarm.)

186
00:07:19,830 --> 00:07:21,510
But I'm at Stage 9
of the Body Tempering Realm.

187
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:23,360
Everyone saw it, right?

188
00:07:23,560 --> 00:07:24,040
Well...

189
00:07:24,430 --> 00:07:25,120
Exactly.

190
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:27,830
You?

191
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:30,390
Going from Stage 1 to Stage 9
in one day?

192
00:07:30,870 --> 00:07:31,630
Impossible!

193
00:07:31,830 --> 00:07:32,870
The test result isn't reliable.

194
00:07:33,070 --> 00:07:33,870
Are you saying

195
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:35,190
all the previous results
weren't reliable?

196
00:07:35,390 --> 00:07:35,800
Well...

197
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:41,680
The previous results were reliable.

198
00:07:41,870 --> 00:07:43,830
But Cuihua's astonishing test

199
00:07:44,120 --> 00:07:44,630
further damaged

200
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:46,310
the spirit stone.

201
00:07:46,510 --> 00:07:48,430
So it malfunctioned during your test,

202
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:49,920
and eventually broke.

203
00:07:50,270 --> 00:07:50,750
That makes sense.

204
00:07:51,310 --> 00:07:51,950
Exactly.

205
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:55,560
So you doubt my cultivation?

206
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:56,560
Then

207
00:07:57,310 --> 00:07:58,430
test me yourself.

208
00:07:58,950 --> 00:07:59,830
Sure.

209
00:08:01,310 --> 00:08:02,630
Since you put it that way,

210
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:04,830
I won't refuse.

211
00:08:04,920 --> 00:08:05,430
Nonsense.

212
00:08:05,920 --> 00:08:07,870
No private duels among fellow disciples!

213
00:08:08,510 --> 00:08:08,950
Sect Master,

214
00:08:09,920 --> 00:08:11,360
the testing stone malfunctioned.

215
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:12,360
That's on me.

216
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:14,560
Since Zhao Feiyang claims

217
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:15,600
his cultivation is genuine

218
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:17,560
and he wishes to stay
as a formal disciple,

219
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:19,630
why not let them spar

220
00:08:19,950 --> 00:08:22,560
and see if he's telling the truth?

221
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:24,560
Sect Master,

222
00:08:24,870 --> 00:08:27,040
if Zhao Feiyang's truly capable

223
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:30,000
of rising from Stage 1 to Stage 9
in one day,

224
00:08:30,510 --> 00:08:32,120
despite his unranked Dao Bone,

225
00:08:32,390 --> 00:08:32,960
his future

226
00:08:33,440 --> 00:08:34,910
is still promising.

227
00:08:37,390 --> 00:08:37,960
Very well.

228
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,200
Then,

229
00:08:39,510 --> 00:08:41,080
you two may spar.

230
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:41,750
Wang Jie,

231
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:43,440
your cultivation is higher than his.

232
00:08:43,790 --> 00:08:45,030
Don't use your full strength.

233
00:08:45,870 --> 00:08:47,000
Yes, Sect Master.

234
00:08:47,550 --> 00:08:48,550
I know how far to go.

235
00:08:59,270 --> 00:08:59,870
Zhao Feiyang,

236
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:01,840
I'm at Stage 2 of the
Spirit Awakening Realm.

237
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:03,270
You're only at Stage 1 of the
Body Tempering Realm.

238
00:09:03,550 --> 00:09:05,240
I'm more than a full realm above you.

239
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:06,320
But don't worry.

240
00:09:06,510 --> 00:09:08,030
I'll only use ten percent of my strength

241
00:09:08,550 --> 00:09:10,750
to expose your little act.

242
00:09:10,960 --> 00:09:11,840
Enough talk.

243
00:09:12,200 --> 00:09:12,870
Make your move.

244
00:09:13,150 --> 00:09:13,840
You're asking for it!

245
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:18,150
He's that strong?

246
00:09:18,750 --> 00:09:19,840
He actually blocked it?

247
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:20,910
Yeah.

248
00:09:28,240 --> 00:09:28,550
What...

249
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:29,750
He's so powerful?

250
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:31,750
No way.

251
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:36,000
Am I seeing things?

252
00:09:36,390 --> 00:09:37,480
Senior Brother Wang was forced back?

253
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:39,320
You're not seeing things. It's true.

254
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:40,870
No wonder he was once
the chief disciple.

255
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:42,000
He's still got real skill.

256
00:09:42,200 --> 00:09:42,870
Junior Brother Wang,

257
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:44,360
what are you doing?

258
00:09:44,840 --> 00:09:45,480
Stop playing around.

259
00:09:45,630 --> 00:09:46,390
(What's going on?)

260
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:48,670
(I said I'd only use ten percent,)

261
00:09:49,030 --> 00:09:50,390
(but I actually used fifty percent.)

262
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:52,720
(Yet he actually knocked me back.)

263
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:54,720
(Is he really at Stage 9?)

264
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:57,150
Wang Jie underestimated him.

265
00:09:57,750 --> 00:09:58,270
Wang Jie,

266
00:09:58,790 --> 00:09:59,840
don't waste any more time.

267
00:10:00,550 --> 00:10:02,200
Zhao Feiyang's been here
for seven years.

268
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:03,120
He's no slouch in a fight.

269
00:10:03,550 --> 00:10:04,750
You won't beat him

270
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:05,910
using only ten percent.

271
00:10:06,030 --> 00:10:07,320
Raise it to thirty percent now.

272
00:10:07,750 --> 00:10:09,120
Understood.

273
00:10:10,550 --> 00:10:11,150
Zhao Feiyang,

274
00:10:11,320 --> 00:10:13,000
I won't hold back anymore.

275
00:10:13,270 --> 00:10:13,960
(Don't blame me!)

276
00:10:15,200 --> 00:10:16,790
(I'll use all my strength)

277
00:10:17,270 --> 00:10:19,030
(and give you a good beating!)

278
00:10:19,270 --> 00:10:21,030
(He's a whole major realm above me.)

279
00:10:21,750 --> 00:10:23,240
(But if I don't prove myself today,)

280
00:10:23,840 --> 00:10:25,550
(everyone will keep thinking)

281
00:10:26,030 --> 00:10:28,150
(I'm a useless pushover.)

282
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:36,150
Senior Brother Wang can't lose.

283
00:10:42,510 --> 00:10:43,510
Senior Brother Wang's
Mountain-Shifting Palm

284
00:10:43,630 --> 00:10:44,840
reached minor mastery six months ago.

285
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:47,550
Zhao Feiyang's in trouble now.

286
00:11:02,750 --> 00:11:04,150
(Can you believe it?)

287
00:11:04,960 --> 00:11:05,630
(Three years ago,)

288
00:11:05,630 --> 00:11:08,030
(he was our sect's chief disciple.)

289
00:11:08,750 --> 00:11:09,630
(But now,)

290
00:11:11,200 --> 00:11:12,790
(he's like a stray dog.)

291
00:11:25,670 --> 00:11:28,120
Mountain-Shifting Palm!

292
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:29,720
Mountain-Shifting Palm!

293
00:11:35,790 --> 00:11:36,270
What...

294
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:49,790
He's coughing blood!

295
00:11:50,080 --> 00:11:51,320
He's only humiliating himself!

296
00:11:52,910 --> 00:11:53,840
What a fool.

297
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:56,670
He took Wang Jie's
Mountain-Shifting Palm head-on.

298
00:11:57,270 --> 00:11:59,600
Doesn't he know his limits?

299
00:11:59,750 --> 00:12:00,360
Zhao Feiyang,

300
00:12:00,790 --> 00:12:02,600
you can't hold a candle to me.

301
00:12:03,150 --> 00:12:06,000
Keep training...

302
00:12:08,440 --> 00:12:09,630
Senior Brother Wang!

303
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:10,790
Why did he fall?

304
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:22,790
He's injured internally.

305
00:12:23,360 --> 00:12:24,120
He passed out.

306
00:12:29,220 --> 00:12:33,010
♪I once stood on high,
drawing spiritual energy into my blade♪

307
00:12:33,260 --> 00:12:35,410
♪I laughed, pointing at the stars,
young and fearless♪

308
00:12:35,980 --> 00:12:39,530
♪Then came my fall,
with frost and snow on my shoulders♪

309
00:12:39,660 --> 00:12:44,090
♪My Dao foundation was damaged,
yet my Dao heart never wavered♪

310
00:12:44,260 --> 00:12:47,410
♪I crossed countless peaks
to find my answer again♪

311
00:12:48,250 --> 00:12:50,920
♪Through endless trials,
my Nascent Soul came♪

312
00:12:51,140 --> 00:12:54,540
♪Heaven and earth my furnace,
I rose from the flame♪

313
00:12:54,620 --> 00:12:58,350
♪No sword in hand,
yet numberless blades obey♪

314
00:12:59,220 --> 00:13:02,390
♪I seek the Dao beyond the clouds♪

315
00:13:02,660 --> 00:13:05,780
♪Unafraid of countless trials♪

316
00:13:06,580 --> 00:13:09,100
♪With this flesh and soul♪

317
00:13:09,420 --> 00:13:12,650
♪I shall forge a new age♪

318
00:13:12,860 --> 00:13:15,730
♪Let thunder and fire crown me♪

319
00:13:16,100 --> 00:13:19,190
♪Let wind and clouds heed me♪

320
00:13:19,410 --> 00:13:22,050
♪At cultivation's peak♪

321
00:13:22,060 --> 00:13:25,410
♪My first resolve remains unchanged♪

322
00:13:26,180 --> 00:13:28,890
♪The sun and moon turn♪

323
00:13:28,890 --> 00:13:32,410
♪I hear the Great Dao ring♪

324
00:13:32,800 --> 00:13:39,390
♪I am the undying flame♪

325
00:13:40,380 --> 00:13:45,050
♪Looking back when dust settles♪

326
00:13:45,310 --> 00:13:48,410
♪At last I see, immortality♪

327
00:13:48,860 --> 00:13:53,550
♪Lives in your smiles.♪
